  "definition": "Limitation on the Repeated Consecutive Use of Curing to Meet the Community Engagement Requirement",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-06-05",
  "historyNote": "#12733, INTERIM, eff 2-23-19, EXPIRES: 8-22-19; ss by #12796, eff 6-5-19 (formerly He-W 837.13)",
